# Check every text file out with LF, whatever core.autocrlf says on the
# machine. The converters copy and zip source files byte for byte and the
# reference index records their size and hash, so a CRLF working copy
# produces artifacts that no longer match the LF files git stores.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.zip  binary
*.png  binary
*.webp binary
*.mp4  binary
